      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When the weight feels this heavy, the idea of complete escape can seem like the only rational option. This feeling of being fundamentally trapped suggests the pressure isn't just external, but deeply ingrained in your current structure. If leaving everything feels like the only answer, it might be time to explore what that \"leaving\" truly means—is it a physical departure, or a complete internal severance from these expectations? It might be worth seeking a professional therapist who can help you dismantle these core beliefs about what your life \"should\" be.",
